# IMO 2009 P6 workspace/DB development check

- [ ] Despite its filename, this script is not a side-effect-free pytest test.
- [ ] Require explicit authorization before creating DB records or runtime work directories.
- [ ] Confirm it never starts tmux or Devin and never consumes model quota.
- [ ] Use the canonical current fixture and reject dependencies on retired system roots.
- [ ] Distinguish workspace/record preparation from end-to-end absorb correctness.
